I stand near the window of my apartment.
Outside, heavy rain falls.
It is a morning in June right now.
This rain falls very fast.
Over there, that black cloud is huge.
This wind is also cold.
I look at the sky, and I think about my arrival.
I came to Mumbai five months ago.
I arrived here in January.
The weather was very different then.
In January, this city was very dry.
At that time, the weather was mild.
But now, this city is wet everywhere.
Even that road is full of water.
Five months ago, I was very nervous.
Now, I live here happily.
I watch this beautiful rain.
I drink hot tea.
